# Keep the GitHub repository lightweight and focused on analysis notes.

# Ignore everything by default, then re-include the Codex analysis tree.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CHATGPT_CONTEXT.md
!platform-tools/
platform-tools/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/*
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/**

# Never publish heavy/proprietary game artifacts or local tool databases.
*.apk
*.obb
*.pak
*.ucas
*.utoc
*.so
*.dll
*.exe
*.mp4
*.gbf
*.ps
*.log
*.txt
*.pid

# Keep textual Ghidra evidence available to remote AI assistants.
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/*.log
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/*.txt
!platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/ghidra_export_functions.json

# Local Ghidra and compilation artifacts.
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/ghidra_project/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/**/javac_probe/
platform-tools/ApexMobileBackup/Analyse/Codex/Phase3/output/*.pid
